{"document_id": "EventStoryLine - 1_10ecbplus", "title": "1_10ecbplus", "text": "http : / / articles . latimes . com / 2013 / may / 03 / local / la - me - 0504 - lohan - rehab - 20130504 Lindsay Lohan checks into Betty Ford Center May 03 , 2013 After skipping out on entering a Newport Beach rehabilitation facility and facing the prospect of arrest for violating her probation , Lindsay Lohan has checked into the Betty Ford Center to begin a 90 - day court - mandated stay in her reckless driving conviction . Lohan was previously at Betty Ford from September 2010 to January 2011 after a probation violation in a prior drunk driving case . Her latest stay at Betty Ford comes after Lohan rear - ended a truck with her Porsche on Pacific Coast Highway on June 8 , and then lied to police , telling them she was not driving .", "entities": {"EVENT_434faad0c9ec71baa6a91df3c385299b": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "1921a4acdae74182a4b49c3acadc3f23", "trigger_word": "violation", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [15, 16]}]}, "EVENT_0fd62e9b29eb355a665582ca822dce66": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "3f933a06396f719afe7c39b4a9058918", "trigger_word": "drunk", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [19, 20]}]}, "EVENT_70540222392ed30d611c5073a5b3204c": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "28576afa34cabc09003cc35a681faeb6", "trigger_word": "case", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [21, 22]}]}, "EVENT_a6c700ffee90bb400461d1687e2287b9": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "104fc943ce50696126c2e22691c69d8d", "trigger_word": "stay", "sent_id": 5, "offset": [2, 3]}]}, "EVENT_401ce8fe35db27ca7b5f7cf83acc4084": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "f0976686f3dfabddf2ef483a668528bc", "trigger_word": "rear - ended", "sent_id": 5, "offset": [9, 12]}]}, "EVENT_a8934f381d6d835057ba8c537386ff9e": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "aea578cea8bab05b5cbcc25a989139e2", "trigger_word": "lied", "sent_id": 5, "offset": [27, 28]}]}, "EVENT_f83b48c549abe22d26dc21624d8de397": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "99e00d4f5b872b1fa8772ada4