{"document_id": "EventStoryLine - 1_13ecbplus", "title": "1_13ecbplus", "text": "http : / / www . ontheredcarpet . com / Lindsay - Lohan - checks - into - rehab - to - begin - 90 - day - stint - - lawyer - says / 9087997 Lindsay Lohan checks into rehab to begin 90 - day stint , lawyer says 05 / 02 / 2013 Lindsay Lohan has checked into a rehab facility to begin a 90 - day court - ordered stint , handed down as part of a sentence for a 2012 car crash case . However , it remains unclear whether a judge will accept her placement at the center , whose location was not revealed publicly , the Associated Press reported , quoting her lawyer Mark Heller as saying on May 2 that prosecutors have not approved it yet . One of them told the judge he needed more time to investigate the place and the judge has given him a May 10 deadline , the news wire said .", "entities": {"EVENT_989757064194b59e8f5e866d7293c8b9": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "aed856dc7fcfe52ef84535f0f8e30b3d", "trigger_word": "approved", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [42, 43]}]}, "EVENT_5997908638be35f828c6080fa105c945": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "ef4138714a10e5fbef223362ee40b09f", "trigger_word": "investigate", "sent_id": 5, "offset": [11, 12]}]}, "EVENT_804eb03284f7e7551bc7a42c3bc293ff": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "5b5570cc8a84b04da4d0c751483f1655", "trigger_word": "checks into", "sent_id": 1, "offset": [2, 4]}]}, "EVENT_c2c18ccb77f8883c3b28416689f980c6": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "3c4d5259bc787385c5616285585c8576", "trigger_word": "stint", "sent_id": 1, "offset": [10, 11]}]}, "EVENT_7e86abd25409e42cb634203089b5b581": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "f99a5138b3b9b4c892a72bbb31c6966c", "trigger_word": "checked into", "sent_id": 3, "offset": [3, 5]}]}, "EVENT_851abb2f6d2c50a68a4bd0e7247553d6": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "516cb76952e743ebcf991741ad0b6e5b", "trigger_word": "stint", "sent_id": 3, "offset": [17, 18]}]}, "EVENT_99b50810f136e74b2dc07c6d3f5ab54b": {"type": null, "me