{"document_id": "EventStoryLine - 1_15ecbplus", "title": "1_15ecbplus", "text": "http : / / www . starpulse . com / news / index . php / 2013 / 05 / 03 / lindsay _ lohan _ check _ into _ betty _ ford _ af Lindsay Lohan Check Into Betty Ford After Fleeing Other Rehab Facility May 3rd , 2013 2 : 00pm EDT After leaving rehab in Newport Beach , Calif . , less than an hour after checking in on Thursday , Lindsay Lohan admitted herself to the Betty Ford Center , according to TMZ . com . Her lawyer negotiated with court officials to change the venue of her 90 - day treatment , and the actress traveled to nearby Rancho Mirage to register as a patient . The actress spent time at the Betty Ford Center in 2010 ; however , a member of the staff ended up suing her for assault .", "entities": {"EVENT_2ba98efbbea00bccc7727ba66fdb22aa": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "75a7f2ed8e1d30c9e03ff4d495056538", "trigger_word": "treatment", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [15, 16]}]}, "EVENT_2a260fd58d9cc1bd359dd3de3d421f7c": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "b7615dcad8bbd1ddc8ede6d1a2ac77c3", "trigger_word": "traveled", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [20, 21]}]}, "EVENT_9b369b48f3fa10334cbc09a72ebea4ec": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "58e19c7845c7da52d8e5c65a22dfb472", "trigger_word": "register", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [26, 27]}]}, "EVENT_b3b88bb236087cf0510c1f9e0e0b20f2": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "8bcfcf06d09d651783d44fa79135d568", "trigger_word": "suing", "sent_id": 5, "offset": [21, 22]}]}, "EVENT_912c50653fced8ae0fa003621818f02c": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "9b97a74154b98f3e677c54af2b0c5c0f", "trigger_word": "assault", "sent_id": 5, "offset": [24, 25]}]}, "EVENT_52844a09cd691de65fe975808595d609": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "ff1aa9fd47629279e28c022c6f61ce40", "trigger_word": "Check Into", "sent_id": 1, "offset": [2, 4]}]}, "EVENT_31563733dc559a817a5e186562869585": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "e7095b8a7ecb26512feb90be86712eb0", "trigger_word": "Fleeing", "sen