{"document_id": "EventStoryLine - 1_16ecbplus", "title": "1_16ecbplus", "text": "http : / / www . thehollywoodgossip . com / 2013 / 05 / lindsay - lohan - checks - into - rehab - in - newport - beach - investigation - p / Lindsay Lohan Checks Into Rehab in Newport Beach ; Investigation of Facility Pending May 2 , 2013 1 : 35 pm . Lindsay Lohan has checked into rehab in Newport Beach , Calif . , and will remain there for the time being , pending an investigation of the facility she chose . This despite the fact that , at the 11th hour , Lohan bailed on rehab in a New York facility that was approved by prosecutors and a judge and flew to L . A .", "entities": {"EVENT_a8c0ed3762a7e8eaf100a84336a4079f": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "9fa6f96e1882604b9e99ec8b20f94a54", "trigger_word": "bailed", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [12, 13]}]}, "EVENT_b97359d7a34cb60358e44263ad3bb28c": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "dd636ac90b4eca661ce50d0823ec2a30", "trigger_word": "flew", "sent_id": 4, "offset": [29, 30]}]}, "EVENT_674adf361072aae44aa9a1cb640651fd": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "788f72d5e052ade97a55e63e84c5d510", "trigger_word": "Investigation", "sent_id": 1, "offset": [9, 10]}]}, "EVENT_d7c7b1b4be19f2467e05e62b8dc7af28": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "f88a64a6ceca7c49e614f5779f3f5a56", "trigger_word": "investigation", "sent_id": 3, "offset": [24, 25]}]}, "EVENT_89e5c0e52e49f8c7cd37522621ddeeb1": {"type": null, "mentions": [{"id": "ba4b0d39b232e7f9b96fa9b6b75f0aff", "trigger_word": "chose", "sent_id": 3, "offset": [29, 30]}]}}, "relations": {"FALLING_ACTION": [["EVENT_d7c7b1b4be19f2467e05e62b8dc7af28", "EVENT_89e5c0e52e49f8c7cd37522621ddeeb1"], ["EVENT_674adf361072aae44aa9a1cb640651fd", "EVENT_89e5c0e52e49f8c7cd37522621ddeeb1"]], "PRECONDITION": [["EVENT_a8c0ed3762a7e8eaf100a84336a4079f", "EVENT_b97359d7a34cb60358e44263ad3bb28c"]]}}
